  "[OT_MATCH_4]", "Swap these gems to match 4-of-a-kind. This gives you an extra turn.";
  "[OT_MATCH_5]", "Swap these gems to match 5-of-a-kind. This gives an extra turn and creates a Wildcard.";
  "[OT_MATCH_BLUE0]", "Swap these gems to match some Blue Mana. You use Blue Mana for casting spells.";
  "[OT_MATCH_BLUE1]", "Try to match mana that your enemy needs. This will stop him casting spells at you.";
  "[OT_MATCH_GOLD0]", "Swap these gems to match some Gold. You can spend gold in between battles.";
  "[OT_MATCH_GOLD1]", "You can use Gold in the Shop after this battle to buy items for your Hero.";
  "[OT_MATCH_GREEN0]", "Swap these gems to match some Green Mana. You use Green Mana for casting spells.";
  "[OT_MATCH_GREEN1]", "When you match mana gems, you will see the mana reserves next to your portrait fill up.";
  "[OT_MATCH_RED0]", "Swap these gems to match some Red Mana. You use Red Mana for casting spells.";
  "[OT_MATCH_RED1]", "Try to match the correct mana for the spells you want to cast.";
  "[OT_MATCH_SKULLS0]", "Swap these gems to match 3 Skulls. This will damage your opponent.";
  "[OT_MATCH_SKULLS1]", "Match some more Skulls here. Each Skull does one point of damage.";
  "[OT_MATCH_SKULLS2]", "Skulls are the most important gems on the board. Try not to miss any!";
  "[OT_MATCH_SKULLS3]", "If you don't match skulls and damage your opponent, he will use them against you!";
  "[OT_MATCH_SKULLS4]", "As your character gains levels and improves their Battle skill, Skulls will do more damage.";
  "[OT_MATCH_SKULLS5]", "Try not to set up any Skulls for your opponent. Think one move ahead!";
  "[OT_MATCH_STARS0]", "Keep matching 3 of a kind. These Purple Stars will give you Experience and help you gain levels.";
  "[OT_MATCH_STARS1]", "Here are some more Purple Stars to match. Each one gives you one point of Experience.";
  "[OT_MATCH_YELLOW0]", "Swap these gems to match some Yellow Mana. You use Yellow Mana for casting spells.";
  "[OT_MATCH_YELLOW1]", "As you gain levels and improve skills, mana gems will give more and more mana.";
  "[OT_REDSKULL0]", "This is a +5 Skull. It matches with other Skulls. It does +5 damage and explodes!";
  "[OT_REDSKULL1]", "When it explodes a +5 Skull destroys (and gives effects for) all other gems around it.";
  "[OT_SPELLCASTING0]", "You have enough mana to use this spell. Try casting it if you think it would be useful.";
  "[OT_SPELLCASTING1]", "A spell is active again. You will learn new spells when you gain levels.";
  "[OT_SPELLCASTING2]", "Don't forget to keep an eye on your spells.  You have enough mana for this one.";
  "[OT_SPELLCASTING3]", "Each spell shows its mana cost on the button. Powerful spells have high mana costs.";
  "[OT_SPELLCASTING4]", "Remember to check your enemy's spells too. Try to deny him the mana he needs.";
  "[OT_WILDCARD0]", "This is a Wildcard. It matches any mana color and multiplies the amount of mana it gives.";
  "[OT_WILDCARD1]", "Remember that Wildcards only match mana gems, not Skulls, Gold or Purple Stars.";
  "[PETS]", "Captives";
  "[PETS_DETAILS]", "%d of %d Enemies captured";
  "[PETS_HELP]", "This shows all the enemies you have captured. \\n If you have built a Mage Tower in your Citadel, you may learn spells from these captives.";
