  "[QUESTACTION_HEADING]", "Actions";
  "[QUESTACTION_TEXT]", "Once you have reached a destination, you may need to do something. \\n Each sparkling location has a list of actions you can perform. Select Siria now and choose 'Visit your Father'.";
  "[QUESTINTRO2_HEADING]", "Quests";
  "[QUESTINTRO2_HEADING_a]", "Quests";
  "[QUESTINTRO2_TEXT]", "Any city with a '!' above it has a quest for you. A red '!' means it is an important story quest. \\n To get your first quest from Bartonia, select the city and choose 'Get Quests'.";
  "[QUESTINTRO2_TEXT_a]", "Any city with a '!' above it has a quest for you. A red '!' means it is an important story quest. \\n To get your first quest, move to Bartonia, select the city and choose 'Get Quests'.";
  "[QUESTINTRO_HEADING]", "Welcome to Etheria";
  "[QUESTINTRO_HEADING_a]", "Welcome to Etheria";
  "[QUESTINTRO_TEXT]", "You are standing in the Citadel of Bartonia, deep in the Agarian forest. \\n You will travel through Etheria by getting and completing a series of quests, available from cities around the map.";
  "[QUESTINTRO_TEXT_a]", "I see you have already been traveling around! \\n To progress, you will need to do more than travel; you will need to obtain and complete a series of quests. Your first quest is available in Bartonia.";
  "[QUESTLEVEL0]", "Levels %d - %d   (Walkover)";
  "[QUESTLEVEL1]", "Levels %d - %d   (Easy)";
  "[QUESTLEVEL2]", "Levels %d - %d   (Average)";
  "[QUESTLEVEL3]", "Levels %d - %d   (Tough)";
  "[QUESTLEVEL4]", "Levels %d - %d   (Impossible)";
  "[QUESTLOCKEDDESC]", "This quest is not available yet. You must first complete some other tasks (see the description in the top right for more details).";
  "[QUESTLOCKED]", "This quest is not available yet";
  "[QUESTMOREQUESTS_HEADING]", "More Quests";
  "[QUESTMOREQUESTS_TEXT]", "Congratulations! You have completed your first quest. \\n You will see that another quest is available back in Bartonia, so you should travel back there now and get it.  Good luck!";
  "[QUESTMOVE_HEADING]", "Movement";
  "[QUESTMOVE_TEXT]", "To go to a new location, simply move the cursor there, select it and your hero will walk there. \\n You need to travel to Siria - the small tower to the right of Bartonia with the sparkles on it.  Select it now.";
  "[QUESTPROGRESS]", "Score : +%06d    Gold +%d    XP +%d";
  "[QUESTREQ]", "Requires :  ";
  "[QUESTSEP]", ", ";
  "[QUEST]", "Quest";
  "[QUEST_CONTINUE]", "Story Complete!";
  "[QUEST_CONTINUE_TEXT]", "You have finished the main storyline of Puzzle Quest, but you may still continue to play, completing side quests, fighting encounters on the roads, and building your Empire.";
  "[QUEST_Q0E0_DESC]", "Necromancers in Skelheim have stolen Catapults and threaten to attack Drakenburg. You must destroy the Catapults.";
  "[QUEST_Q0E0_NAME]", "Stolen Catapult";
  "[QUEST_Q0E1_DESC]", "Storms have been driving Sea Serpents into the Drakenburg sewers. You must clear them out.";
  "[QUEST_Q0E1_NAME]", "Storms At Sea";
  "[QUEST_Q0I0_DESC]", "An old Troll, Egor the Aged, has been blocking a bridge on the River Maethel, causing trouble for all who pass by. You must chase him away.";
  "[QUEST_Q0I0_NAME]", "Troll Trouble";
  "[QUEST_Q0I1_DESC]", "Giant Spiders have infested the Ancient Grove where the Elenian Druids hold their ceremonies. If you can slay the largest of these spiders, the rest will probably leave.";
  "[QUEST_Q0I1_NAME]", "Spider Bait";
  "[QUEST_Q0I2_DESC]", "The Queen of Bartonia needs a message delivered to the Emperor of Selentia, far away in the Selentine capital of Enmouth.";
  "[QUEST_Q0I2_NAME]", "Imperial Message";
  "[QUEST_Q0I3_DESC]", "Some Minotaur Slavers have been harrassing the Selentine Empire. You must help drive them off.";
  "[QUEST_Q0I3_NAME]", "Slavers";
  "[QUEST_Q0I4_DESC]", "You must escort the Emperor's daughter, Princess Serephine, to the Trarg where she is to wed the leader of the Horse Tribes, Utrarg of Trarg.";
  "[QUEST_Q0I4_NAME]", "The Marriage";
  "[QUEST_Q0I5_DESC]", "You must take the Emperor's reply back to Queen Gwendholyn in Bartonia.";
  "[QUEST_Q0I5_NAME]", "Imperial Reply";
  "[QUEST_Q0I6_DESC]", "You must seek out and train with each of the 5 Orders of Agarian Knights and then choose an Order to join.";
  "[QUEST_Q0I6_NAME]", "Knightly Orders";
  "[QUEST_Q0I7_DESC]", "Bats have infested a tower in the Royal Crypt. You must travel there and chase them away.";
  "[QUEST_Q0I7_NAME]", "Bats in the Belfry";
  "[QUEST_Q0Q0_DESC]", "A sealed message must be delivered to Sir Albion in Siria.  This is an important message, and you may be in danger as you travel there.";
  "[QUEST_Q0Q0_NAME]", "The Missive";
  "[QUEST_Q0Q1_DESC]", "A Skeleton has been terrorizing the peasants near the Royal Crypt in western Theira.  Nobody is sure where it came from, though whispers say that a cult of necromancers are to blame.  You must find the Skeleton and lay it to rest.";
  "[QUEST_Q0Q1_NAME]", "Rogue Skeleton";
  "[QUEST_Q0Q2_DESC]", "Undead are beginning to appear all over Agaria.  You must travel south over the mountains in search of a warrior named Darkhunter - a specialist in combat against the Undead.";
  "[QUEST_Q0Q2_NAME]", "Darkhunter";
  "[QUEST_Q0Q3_DESC]", "Darkhunter is heading out to the Skell Marshes to track down an evil Sorcerer.  He requires some help to hold the Sorcerer's minions at bay.";
  "[QUEST_Q0Q3_NAME]", "Helping Hand";
  "[QUEST_Q0Q4_DESC]", "You must escort a captive Sorcerer to the Red Tower - the home citadel of the Riverguard, located in Maethelburg.";
  "[QUEST_Q0Q4_NAME]", "The Prisoner";
  "[QUEST_Q0Q5_DESC]", "A band of Orcs recently traveled over the Hammer Pass, took some prisoners and headed back to Kor.  You must try to catch them and rescue the prisoners.";
  "[QUEST_Q0Q5_NAME]", "Rescue Mission";
  "[QUEST_Q0Q6_DESC]", "A strange Undead creature - a Liche - is blocking access to the forest of Silvermyr.  The Wood Elves need help fighting it.";
  "[QUEST_Q0Q6_NAME]", "None Shall Pass";
  "[QUEST_Q0Q7_DESC]", "A Dwarf by the name of Khalkus has requested your aid in getting a caravan of supplies safely through Agaria.";
  "[QUEST_Q0Q7_NAME]", "Dwarven Caravan";
  "[QUEST_Q0Q8_DESC]", "You must deliver news of Dugog's demise to Queen Gwendholyn in Bartonia.";
  "[QUEST_Q0Q8_NAME]", "Good Tidings";
  "[QUEST_Q0R0_DESC]", "The Elenian Knights regularly patrol the forests of Agaria, looking for signs of trouble.  You must perform one such patrol, traveling from Bartonia to Elenia and back again.";
  "[QUEST_Q0R0_NAME]", "Patrol Duty";
  "[QUEST_Q0R1_DESC]", "Harpies have infested the Old Outpost again - an ancient Selentine Tower on the edge of the forest that was overrun by Elenian archers 100 years ago. You must clean out the Tower.";
  "[QUEST_Q0R1_NAME]", "Harpy Infestation";
  "[QUEST_Q0S0_DESC]", "Giant Rats have been plaguing Gildor. You must seek out the largest of these rats and slay it.";
  "[QUEST_Q0S0_NAME]", "Beneath Gildor";
  "[QUEST_Q0S1_DESC]", "A pair of Ogres have built a tower to the east.  You must go and chase them back over the mountains into Kor.";
  "[QUEST_Q0S1_NAME]", "Ogre Twins";
  "[QUEST_Q0S2_DESC]", "The Green Dragon who lives in the mountains nearby has not been seen for some time. You must travel to his cave and see if he is there.";
  "[QUEST_Q0S2_NAME]", "Dragonsearch";
  "[QUEST_Q0S3_DESC]", "A young Squire named Erik is seeking your help.  His father, Lord Michael, was captured by Orcs as they traveled past the Ogre's Tower.  You must travel there and rescue him.";
  "[QUEST_Q0S3_NAME]", "Father and Son";
  "[QUEST_Q0S4_DESC]", "Every year the Elves of Silvermyr deliver a gift to Embraxus, the Dragon of the Alfland Swamp. They have asked you to take the gift for them this year.";
  "[QUEST_Q0S4_NAME]", "Lord of the Swamp";
  "[QUEST_Q0T0_DESC]", "Your father has requested your presence in Siria.  You must travel there and meet him.";
  "[QUEST_Q0T0_NAME]", "Family Reunion";
  "[QUEST_Q0T1_DESC]", "You must learn some basic combat against a Practice Dummy.";
  "[QUEST_Q0T1_NAME]", "Practice Dummy";
  "[QUEST_Q0T2_DESC]", "You must learn some more advanced combat by practicing against a Young Knight.";
  "[QUEST_Q0T2_NAME]", "Advanced Combat";
  "[QUEST_Q1D0_DESC]", "Drong the Ogre is looking for someone to hunt down some exotic creatures for him to eat.";
  "[QUEST_Q1D0_NAME]", "Spider Meat";
  "[QUEST_Q1D1_DESC]", "Drong the Ogre is after some more food - this time it is a Troll.";
  "[QUEST_Q1D1_NAME]", "Troll Meat";
  "[QUEST_Q1D2_DESC]", "Drong the Ogre is after some more food - this time it is a Wyvern.";
  "[QUEST_Q1D2_NAME]", "Wyvern Meat";
  "[QUEST_Q1D3_DESC]", "Drong the Ogre has a special request for you. There is something very unusual that he would like you get for him to eat.";
  "[QUEST_Q1D3_NAME]", "Ogre Meat";
  "[QUEST_Q1D4_DESC]", "Drong the Ogre would like you fetch him a serpent to eat, but not just any serpent will do...";
  "[QUEST_Q1D4_NAME]", "Serpent Meat";
  "[QUEST_Q1E0_DESC]", "Lord Bane's servants have been snuffing out the beacon fires in the passes. You must capture new Fire Elementals and re-light them.";
  "[QUEST_Q1E0_NAME]", "Beacon Fires";
  "[QUEST_Q1E1_DESC]", "Neehi the Goblin will pay 150 Gold for each Wasp Stinger you bring him.";
  "[QUEST_Q1E1_NAME]", "Antidote";
  "[QUEST_Q1E2_DESC]", "The Orc Tribes are building Gobshooters again, and the Dwarves are concerned it may lead to war. You must destroy their latest creation.";
  "[QUEST_Q1E2_NAME]", "Incoming!";
  "[QUEST_Q1G1_DESC]", "Neehi, the Goblin Trader, needs a brave person to go and collect some spell components.";
  "[QUEST_Q1G1_NAME]", "Reagent Hunt";
  "[QUEST_Q1G2_DESC]", "Neehi, the Goblin Merchant, needs you to travel over the mountains and exchange some items for him.";
  "[QUEST_Q1G2_NAME]", "Tit for Tat";
  "[QUEST_Q1G3_DESC]", "Neehi the merchant needs you to take the limb and the axe-head over the mountains to be assembled into an axe.";
  "[QUEST_Q1G3_NAME]", "Reassembly";
  "[QUEST_Q1Q0_DESC]", "With the death of Dugog, the Orc tribes have been thrown into chaos.  You must travel to 4 Orc villages and defeat their leaders to quiet them down.";
  "[QUEST_Q1Q0_NAME]", "Tribal Chaos";
  "[QUEST_Q1Q1_DESC]", "You must travel deep into Kor to meet with Gruulkar, the Great Orc, Lord of Kor.  You must then convince Gruulkar to tell you why the Orcs are taking prisoners.";
  "[QUEST_Q1Q1_NAME]", "Lord of Orcs";
  "[QUEST_Q1Q2_DESC]", "The Ogres in the south are getting restless.  Somebody needs to travel down there and sort them out.";
  "[QUEST_Q1Q2_NAME]", "Ogre Tactics";
  "[QUEST_Q1Q3_DESC]", "You must stop any further threat from the Ogres by defeating their leader.";
  "[QUEST_Q1Q3_NAME]", "Ogre Magic";
  "[QUEST_Q1Q4_DESC]", "You must try to stop Gruulkar from gathering the hordes and going to war in Northern Kor.";
  "[QUEST_Q1Q4_NAME]", "War Council";
  "[QUEST_Q1Q5_DESC]", "Gruulkar is building a new weapon. You must find it and destroy it.";
  "[QUEST_Q1Q5_NAME]", "The Gobshooter";
  "[QUEST_Q1Q6_DESC]", "You must travel south and defeat Gruulkar himself.";
  "[QUEST_Q1Q6_NAME]", "Gruulkar";
  "[QUEST_Q1Q7_DESC]", "You must dispose of a Dragon that has been caught in a Dragontrap north of Dhun-Kor.";
  "[QUEST_Q1Q7_NAME]", "Dragontrap";
  "[QUEST_Q1Q8_DESC]", "You must attempt to wake Kelthurax who slumbers beneath the Dragonrealm. He is the oldest Dragon in Etheria.";
  "[QUEST_Q1Q8_NAME]", "Waking Kelthurax";
  "[QUEST_Q1Q9_DESC]", "You must travel to the Hornburg to confront the Mechataur.  Hopefully, you will discover who or what is behind the attacks on your homeland.";
  "[QUEST_Q1Q9_NAME]", "The Mechataur";
  "[QUEST_Q1R0_DESC]", "You must travel to the lair of the Frost Dragon, Chilblain, to see if he is still there.";
  "[QUEST_Q1R0_NAME]", "Frost Hunt";
  "[QUEST_Q1R1_DESC]", "You must search the lair of Umbra the Flame Dragon, to see if there is any sign of where the Dragons have gone.";
  "[QUEST_Q1R1_NAME]", "Flame Hunt";
  "[QUEST_Q1R2_DESC]", "You must travel to the lair of Morass, the Swamp Dragon, to see if you can find any clues about where the Dragons have gone.";
  "[QUEST_Q1R2_NAME]", "Swamp Hunt";
  "[QUEST_Q1R3_DESC]", "You must continue hunting around the Dragonrealm, searching for anything that might be a clue as to the Dragons' whereabouts.";
  "[QUEST_Q1R3_NAME]", "More Hunting";
  "[QUEST_Q1S0_DESC]", "An ancient Dwarven heirloom was stolen from one of the previous caravans attacked by Ogres.  Khalkus would like you to retrieve it.";
  "[QUEST_Q1S0_NAME]", "Dwarven Heirloom";
  "[QUEST_Q1S1_DESC]", "A giant worm has been seen in Eastern Kor. It is said to have swallowed a huge treasure.";
  "[QUEST_Q1S1_NAME]", "The Worm Turns";
  "[QUEST_Q1S2_DESC]", "You must defeat two Giant Scorpions that live in a cave north of Dhun-Kor.  They have been harrassing miners from the city on their way to the mountains.";
  "[QUEST_Q1S2_NAME]", "The Sting";
  "[QUEST_Q1S3_DESC]", "Some Orcs were sighted traveling though Northern Kor with a group of slaves they captured in Agaria. You must stop them.";
  "[QUEST_Q1S3_NAME]", "Slave Caravan";
  "[QUEST_Q1S4_DESC]", "A crazy Goblin thief has stolen a relic from the Temple of Ymorgia in Gruuldok.  He was seen last near White Skull.  You must find him and retrieve the relic.";
  "[QUEST_Q1S4_NAME]", "Crazy Goblin";
  "[QUEST_Q2G0_DESC]", "You have found a Gnoll hiding in a hole in the ground.  You must try and find out what is wrong, and then help him.";
  "[QUEST_Q2G0_NAME]", "Gnoll in a Hole";
  "[QUEST_Q2G1_DESC]", "You must find three more Assassins that are after Patch the Gnoll.";
  "[QUEST_Q2G1_NAME]", "Gnoll Hunters";
  "[QUEST_Q2G2_DESC]", "You must tie up one final loose end to help Patch the Gnoll.";
  "[QUEST_Q2G2_NAME]", "Master Assassin";
  "[QUEST_Q2I0_DESC]", "You must travel to Arik's Arena to battle the Minotaur King and recover a magical Helm.";
  "[QUEST_Q2I0_NAME]", "Prized Helm";
  "[QUEST_Q2I1_DESC]", "You must journey to the Volcano and help the Firewalkers to relight their Sacred Flame.";
  "[QUEST_Q2I1_NAME]", "Sacred Flame";
  "[QUEST_Q2I2_DESC]", "You must chase away the Gnolls that have been desecrating the Pike.";
  "[QUEST_Q2I2_NAME]", "Gnoll Raiders";
  "[QUEST_Q2I3_DESC]", "Rogue Minotaur tribes are causing havok in the Realms of War. Track them down and stop them.";
  "[QUEST_Q2I3_NAME]", "Endless War";
  "[QUEST_Q2I4_DESC]", "The pass to Ar has been blocked by Hill Giants.  You must confront them, chase them away and clear a path.";
  "[QUEST_Q2I4_NAME]", "Arioc Blockade";
  "[QUEST_Q2I5_DESC]", "You must deliver an invitation to two Giants, Jarl and Jotun.  They have been invited to attend a tournament in Tusk.";
  "[QUEST_Q2I5_NAME]", "The Invitations";
  "[QUEST_Q2I6_DESC]", "You must somehow replace the Orb you stole from the Elves of Silvermyr.";
  "[QUEST_Q2I6_NAME]", "Fresh Eyes";
  "[QUEST_Q2J0_DESC]", "Jotun the Fire Giant has stolen Jarl's Hammer. You must take it back and return it to its rightful owner.";
  "[QUEST_Q2J0_NAME]", "Jarl's Hammer";
  "[QUEST_Q2J1_DESC]", "Jarl the Frost Giant has stolen Jotun's Helm. You must find and return it.";
  "[QUEST_Q2J1_NAME]", "Jotun's Helm";
  "[QUEST_Q2J2_DESC]", "Jotun the Fire Giant has stolen Jarl's Cloak. You must take it back and return it to its rightful owner.";
  "[QUEST_Q2J2_NAME]", "Jarl's Cloak";
  "[QUEST_Q2J3_DESC]", "Jarl the Frost Giant has stolen Jotun's Boots. You must find them and return them.";
  "[QUEST_Q2J3_NAME]", "Jotun's Boots";
  "[QUEST_Q2J4_DESC]", "You must try to put an end to Jarl and Jotun stealing each others' things.";
  "[QUEST_Q2J4_NAME]", "Brotherly Love";
  "[QUEST_Q2M0_DESC]", "You must seek out the Minotaur, Red-Axe, to train you and improve your skills with the axe.";
  "[QUEST_Q2M0_NAME]", "Red-Axe";
  "[QUEST_Q2M1_DESC]", "You must travel to the Wyverns' Roost, slaying a Wyvern and studying its combat technique to learn more about using an axe.";
  "[QUEST_Q2M1_NAME]", "Trial of the Wyvern";
  "[QUEST_Q2M2_DESC]", "You must travel to the Worm Cave, slaying a Sandworm and studying its combat technique to learn more about using an axe.";
  "[QUEST_Q2M2_NAME]", "Trial of the Worm";
  "[QUEST_Q2M3_DESC]", "You must travel to the Scorpions' Cave, slay a Giant Scorpion while studying its combat technique to learn more about using an axe.";
  "[QUEST_Q2M3_NAME]", "Trial of the Scorpion";
  "[QUEST_Q2M4_DESC]", "You must complete the final trial in your effort to become a Master of the Axe.";
  "[QUEST_Q2M4_NAME]", "Trial of Blood";
  "[QUEST_Q2Q0_DESC]", "You have followed the trail of the Orcish Slavers to a huge Horned Temple. You must enter the Temple to learn more.";
  "[QUEST_Q2Q0_NAME]", "Slave Trail";
  "[QUEST_Q2Q1_DESC]", "You must undergo a ritual cleansing by the Minotaur Firewalkers.  Once you have done this, they will agree to talk to you.";
  "[QUEST_Q2Q1_NAME]", "Trial by Fire";
  "[QUEST_Q2Q2_DESC]", "You must challenge a Minotaur Tribe in an attempt to reclaim the Horns of Sartek.";
  "[QUEST_Q2Q2_NAME]", "Horns of Sartek";
  "[QUEST_Q2Q3_DESC]", "You must obtain the Eye of Sartek from the Elves and return it to the Horned Temple.";
  "[QUEST_Q2Q3_NAME]", "Eye of Sartek";
  "[QUEST_Q2Q4_DESC]", "You must defeat a Minotaur Slaver who wields the legendary Tail of Sartek as a whip.  Then you must return the Tail to the Horned Temple.";
  "[QUEST_Q2Q4_NAME]", "Tail of Sartek";
  "[QUEST_Q2Q5_DESC]", "You must obtain the Tooth of Sartek from the Gnoll Chieftain in Hyaan and return it to Tauron.";
  "[QUEST_Q2Q5_NAME]", "Tooth of Sartek";
  "[QUEST_Q2Q6_DESC]", "You must travel into Southern Kor and find an Ogre Mage that has made the Spine of Sartek into a war banner.";
  "[QUEST_Q2Q6_NAME]", "Spine of Sartek";
  "[QUEST_Q2Q7_DESC]", "Somewhere in the Realms of War a Minotaur King has hidden the Ribs of Sartek.  You must find them.";
  "[QUEST_Q2Q7_NAME]", "Ribs of Sartek";
  "[QUEST_Q2Q8_DESC]", "You must find a Knight in the Borderlands who has had the Crest of Sartek mounted onto his helm, then return to Tauron with the Crest.";
  "[QUEST_Q2Q8_NAME]", "Crest of Sartek";
  "[QUEST_Q2Q9_DESC]", "You must steal the final piece of Sartek, his huge skull, from Minogoth in the Horned Citadel of Ohtar.";
  "[QUEST_Q2Q9_NAME]", "Skull of Sartek";
  "[QUEST_Q3A0_DESC]", "A Medusa has been attacking travelers near Iceguard Keep and turning them into Ice Statues.  You must stop her.";
  "[QUEST_Q3A0_NAME]", "Ice Statues";
  "[QUEST_Q3A1_DESC]", "Sensing the unrest in this region, young Dragons - children of Ragnar the Ancient Frost Dragon - have been moving down to the coast. You must chase them away.";
  "[QUEST_Q3A1_NAME]", "Children of Ragnar";
  "[QUEST_Q3A2_DESC]", "Harpies from the Hagstone have been traveling down into the High Elven lands. You must confront their Queen to stop them.";
  "[QUEST_Q3A2_NAME]", "Harpy Queen";
  "[QUEST_Q3A3_DESC]", "Dark Dwarven caravans have been sighted leaving for Lord Bane's Citadel. You must stop them from trading with him.";
  "[QUEST_Q3A3_NAME]", "Dark Dealings";
  "[QUEST_Q3A4_DESC]", "Arboleth have been sighted near the Lake of Blood. You must drive them away.";
  "[QUEST_Q3A4_NAME]", "Spawn of Bane";
  "[QUEST_Q3D0_DESC]", "You must search for signs of Elistara's lost dragon, Crystal, at the Bloodstone.";
  "[QUEST_Q3D0_NAME]", "Bloodstone";
  "[QUEST_Q3D1_DESC]", "You must continue your search through the Realms of Death for Elistara's lost Dragon.";
  "[QUEST_Q3D1_NAME]", "Dragontracks";
  "[QUEST_Q3D2_DESC]", "You must accompany Elistara to the Realm of Dragons.";
  "[QUEST_Q3D2_NAME]", "Condolences";
  "[QUEST_Q3D3_DESC]", "You must hunt down the lost dragons and find out what has happened to them.";
  "[QUEST_Q3D3_NAME]", "Sign of Dragons";
  "[QUEST_Q3D4_DESC]", "You must help Flicker to finally find his mother.";
  "[QUEST_Q3D4_NAME]", "Dragon in Chains";
  "[QUEST_Q3E0_DESC]", "You must search Morass' Lair for treasure. You must be cautious. There are Swamp Dragons about!";
  "[QUEST_Q3E0_NAME]", "Gold of Morass";
  "[QUEST_Q3E1_DESC]", "You must search Umbra's Lair for treasure. You must be cautious. There are Flame Dragons about!";
  "[QUEST_Q3E1_NAME]", "Gold of Umbra";
  "[QUEST_Q3E2_DESC]", "You must search Chilbain's Lair for treasure. You must be cautious. There are Frost Dragons about!";
  "[QUEST_Q3E2_NAME]", "Gold of Chilblain";
  "[QUEST_Q3I0_DESC]", "You have been summoned to appear before Queen Ehlanna at Ehlariel.";
  "[QUEST_Q3I0_NAME]", "Royal Summons";
  "[QUEST_Q3I1_DESC]", "Undead have taken over the Ice Crystal Mine near Iceguard Keep. You must help take back the mine.";
  "[QUEST_Q3I1_NAME]", "Elven Forge";
  "[QUEST_Q3I2_DESC]", "Elven Warriors have been taken captive by the Undead. You must rescue them before it is too late.";
  "[QUEST_Q3I2_NAME]", "Elven Captives";
  "[QUEST_Q3I3_DESC]", "You must travel to Iceguard Keep to pick up the trail left by the Undead in order to rescue the remaining captives.";
  "[QUEST_Q3I3_NAME]", "The Baneguard";
  "[QUEST_Q3Q0_DESC]", "You must cross the mountains into the Realms of Death in search of Lord Bane.";
  "[QUEST_Q3Q0_NAME]", "Gornak's Gap";
  "[QUEST_Q3Q1_DESC]", "You must travel to the Ruins of Ylarie in the Northern Tundra and seek help from the High Elves who guard the remaining two passes into Lord Bane's realm.";
  "[QUEST_Q3Q1_NAME]", "Northern Tundra";
  "[QUEST_Q3Q2_DESC]", "You must help the High Elves defend Ylarie against waves of Undead attackers.";
  "[QUEST_Q3Q2_NAME]", "Ylarie Defense";
  "[QUEST_Q3Q3_DESC]", "You must help the High Elves to recapture Skullguard Keep.";
  "[QUEST_Q3Q3_NAME]", "Skullguard Keep";
  "[QUEST_Q3Q4_DESC]", "You must gather some herbs for the High Elven Mages who need them to cast a spell of farseeing.";
  "[QUEST_Q3Q4_NAME]", "The Future";
  "[QUEST_Q3Q5_DESC]", "You must find and defeat the three Generals of Lord Bane's army, evil Sorcerors who are preparing his army of Undead.";
  "[QUEST_Q3Q5_NAME]", "Three Skulls";
  "[QUEST_Q3Q6_DESC]", "You must enter Bane's Citadel and make your way to his throne room, ready to confront him.";
  "[QUEST_Q3Q6_NAME]", "Bane's Citadel";
  "[QUEST_Q3Q7_DESC]", "You must confront and defeat Lord Bane.";
  "[QUEST_Q3Q7_NAME]", "The Final Battle";
  "[QUEST_Q3S0_DESC]", "You must 'follow your sword' in search of a great source of power.";
  "[QUEST_Q3S0_NAME]", "Follow the Sword";
  "[QUEST_Q3W0_DESC]", "A pack of wolves have been terrorizing the Elves at Tirianin. You must chase the wolves away.";
  "[QUEST_Q3W0_NAME]", "Wolf Pack";
  "[QUEST_Q3W1_DESC]", "You must rescue the wolf cubs from being sacrificed by the Doomknight.";
  "[QUEST_Q3W1_NAME]", "Lost Cubs";
  "[QUEST_Q3W2_DESC]", "You must bless the homeland of the wolves. To do this, you must first obtain the Elvenstone from Queen Ehlanna.";
  "[QUEST_Q3W2_NAME]", "Blessings";
  "[QUEST_QA00_DESC]", "You must help Darkhunter search for an old acquaintance in Northern Kor.";
  "[QUEST_QA00_NAME]", "Distant Rumor";
  "[QUEST_QA01_DESC]", "Darkhunter wants to travel to Maethelburg and meet with Lord Greythane.";
  "[QUEST_QA01_NAME]", "Seeking Advice";
  "[QUEST_QA02_DESC]", "Darkhunter wants to go and meet an old acquaintance and would like you to come with him.";
  "[QUEST_QA02_NAME]", "Liandra's Offer";
  "[QUEST_QA03_DESC]", "Darkhunter has received another summons to meet with Liandra. You must accompany him once again.";
  "[QUEST_QA03_NAME]", "Liandra's Return";
  "[QUEST_QA04_DESC]", "You must accompany Darkhunter as he returns Liandra's ashes to her home in Maethelburg.";
  "[QUEST_QA04_NAME]", "Ashes to Ashes";
  "[QUEST_QD00_DESC]", "You must find some granite for Drong to eat.";
  "[QUEST_QD00_NAME]", "Granite";
  "[QUEST_QD01_DESC]", "You must travel to the Volcano with Drong and help him find some tasty Volcanic Rock. The Volcano is home to many Fire Elementals.";
  "[QUEST_QD01_NAME]", "Volcanic Rock";
  "[QUEST_QD02_DESC]", "You must travel to the beach at Tirianin to help find sandstone for Drong to eat. The beach is guarded by Sea Serpents.";
  "[QUEST_QD02_NAME]", "Sandstone";
  "[QUEST_QD03_DESC]", "You must travel to the Lake of Blood to help find diamonds for Drong to eat. The Dark Dwarves are fiercely protective of their diamonds.";
  "[QUEST_QD03_NAME]", "Diamond";
  "[QUEST_QK00_DESC]", "Khalkus would like you to help him find part of a device called the Great Machine.";
  "[QUEST_QK00_NAME]", "First Gear";
  "[QUEST_QK01_DESC]", "You must help Khalkus find the second part of the Great Machine.";
  "[QUEST_QK01_NAME]", "Second Gear";
  "[QUEST_QK02_DESC]", "You must help Khalkus find the third piece of the Great Machine.";
  "[QUEST_QK02_NAME]", "Third Gear";
  "[QUEST_QK04_DESC]", "You must help Khalkus gather the fourth piece of the Great Machine.";
  "[QUEST_QK04_NAME]", "Fourth Gear";
  "[QUEST_QK05_DESC]", "You must help Khalkus find the fifth piece of the Great Machine.";
  "[QUEST_QK05_NAME]", "Fifth Gear";
  "[QUEST_QK06_DESC]", "You must finally help Khalkus put the Great Machine together.";
  "[QUEST_QK06_NAME]", "Assembly Required";
  "[QUEST_QP00_DESC]", "Patch invites you to Hyaan to see his treasure.";
  "[QUEST_QP00_NAME]", "Patch's Hoard";
  "[QUEST_QP01_DESC]", "Track down the thief who stole Patch's treasure.";
  "[QUEST_QP01_NAME]", "Ill-Gotten Gains";
  "[QUEST_QP02_DESC]", "You must travel to Dhun-Kor with Khalkus and Patch to help build a vault for Patch's treasure.";
  "[QUEST_QP02_NAME]", "The Vault";
  "[QUEST_QS00_DESC]", "Princess Serephine receives a secret message from a friend at Enmouth asking for help. You must travel to Enmouth to help Serephine's friend.";
  "[QUEST_QS00_NAME]", "Secret Message";
  "[QUEST_QS01_DESC]", "You must travel to The Trarg and rescue Princess Serephine.";
  "[QUEST_QS01_NAME]", "Shotgun Wedding";
  "[QUEST_QS02_DESC]", "Emperor Selentius has sent a legion of Imperial Guards to search for Princess Serephine and take her home to Enmouth. Tread cautiously.";
  "[QUEST_QS02_NAME]", "Imperial Legion";
  "[QUEST_QU00_DESC]", "Sunspear wishes to talk with you about battling a Frost Giant.";
  "[QUEST_QU00_NAME]", "Age of Honor";
  "[QUEST_QU01_DESC]", "Sunspear wishes to observe you fighting an Arboleth.";
  "[QUEST_QU01_NAME]", "Seeking Death";
  "[QUEST_QU02_DESC]", "Help Sunspear choose the final foe that he wishes to face.";
  "[QUEST_QU02_NAME]", "A Worthy Foe";
  "[QUEST_T1_HEADING]", "Basic Combat";
  "[QUEST_T1_TEXT]", "The objective of combat is to reduce your opponent's Life Points to zero.  You can see his 20 Life Points flashing up in the top right. \\n To make your first combat easier, you are facing a Practice Dummy who cannot fight back, so take your time and experiment.";
  "[QUEST_T1a_HEADING]", "Matching Gems";
  "[QUEST_T1a_TEXT]", "You are doing well! Keep matching groups of 3 gems (especially Skulls) until the Practice Dummy has no Life Points left.";
  "[QUEST_T1aa_GP_TEXT]", "Now you will start swapping gems to make identical lines of 3 or more.  To swap gems, move the cursor on the grid, select the first gem, and then press a directional button to swap it with an adjacent one.";
  "[QUEST_T1aa_HEADING]", "Swapping Gems";
  "[QUEST_T1aa_TEXT]", "Now you will start swapping gems to make identical lines of 3 or more.  To swap gems left-click on the first gem, and then left-click on any gem adjacent to it.";
  "[QUEST_T1b_HEADING]", "Victory";
  "[QUEST_T1b_TEXT]", "I think you are ready for a bigger challenge now - it is time to get your next quest. \\n However, the Practice Dummy is still there for now if you need to practice some more.";
  "[QUEST_T2_HEADING]", "Advanced Combat";
  "[QUEST_T2_TEXT]", "Now it gets tougher - you have an opponent who will fight back. \\n You both take turns matching gems and trying to damage each other. Remember what you have learned!";
  "[QUEST_T2a_HEADING]", "Matching Gems";
  "[QUEST_T2a_TEXT]", "You are doing well! Keep matching groups of 3 gems and casting spells. \\n Try not to allow your opponent to get any Skulls.";
  "[QUEST_T2b_HEADING]", "Victory";
  "[QUEST_T2b_TEXT]", "Congratulations! You have passed with flying colors. You are now a member of the Queen's Guard. \\n And I believe the Queen was looking for you. She has a task for you already.";
  "[QUITCONFIRM]", "Are you certain you want to exit this game?";
  "[QUITMAPCONFIRM]", "Are you certain you want to exit? (your progress will be saved automatically)";
  "[QUITMAP]", "Exit";
