  "[SELECTMOUNTMENU_HEADING]", "Training Mounts";
  "[SELECTMOUNTMENU_TEXT]", "The list shows all of your mounts along with their current level. \\n Successfully training a mount, by defeating a special timed mini-game, adds +1 to its level and helps to improve your skills in combat.";
  "[SELECTRUNEMENU_HEADING]", "Creating Items";
  "[SELECTRUNEMENU_TEXT]", "To create an item, you must select 3 runes and then play a mini-game. \\n Each combination of runes will give a different item, and you need one rune from each category: Base, Modifier and Power. More powerful runes will make the item harder to create.";
  "[SELECTSPELLMENU_HEADING]", "Learning Spells";
  "[SELECTSPELLMENU_TEXT]", "The list shows you all the spells that you may learn from your captives, along with the difficulty of learning that spell. \\n The most powerful spells are quite difficult to learn and you may require a number of attempts to be successful.";
